        97.31520080566406,
        86.75849151611328,
        401.5755615234375,
        101.68949127197266
      ],
      "text": "ey changes since the first edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold-SC700",
      "size": 12.600000381469727,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.38739013671875,
        122.91952514648438,
        269.0953674316406,
        137.1395263671875
      ],
      "text": "Summary of key changes",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        123.20752716064453,
        124.38739013671875,
        137.1395263671875
      ],
      "text": "Table 1.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        147.19871520996094,
        453.3701477050781,
        164.20870971679688
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3 In  , on the diagnosis of TB in children, the second edition covers recent",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        159.70870971679688,
        486.36004638671875,
        175.37872314453125
      ],
      "text": "improvements in diagnostics, such as rapid culture techniques and genotypic (molecular)",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        171.70870971679688,
        504.27008056640625,
        187.54872131347656
      ],
      "text": "techniques (e.g. Xpert MTB/RIF assay) that improve detection of  , Mycobacterium tuberculosis",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        183.70870971679688,
        198.69029235839844,
        199.37872314453125
      ],
      "text": "and their use in children.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        204.2887420654297,
        477.880126953125,
        221.29873657226562
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 4 , on the treatment of TB in children, includes the 2010 revised recommended",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        216.79873657226562,
        488.360107421875,
        232.46875
      ],
      "text": "dosages of the three most commonly used first-line anti-TB drugs for children – isoniazid,",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        228.79873657226562,
        497.4300842285156,
        244.46875
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin and pyrazinamide. Since 2006, new evidence has become available showing that",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        240.79873657226562,
        491.90008544921875,
        256.46875
      ],
      "text": "increased dosages are needed to achieve adequate drug levels in young children. In 2012,",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        252.79873657226562,
        496.4200744628906,
        268.46875
      ],
      "text": "the isoniazid dosage was revised again following a review of new evidence on the results of",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        264.7987365722656,
        326.68023681640625,
        280.46875
      ],
      "text": "treatment of children using the old and new dosages.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        285.3787841796875,
        484.6800842285156,
        302.3887634277344
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 5 The second edition pays greater attention to prevention of TB among children.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        297.8887634277344,
        449.79010009765625,
        313.55877685546875
      ],
      "text": "addresses BCG vaccination and contact investigation as well as infection control.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        318.46875,
        495.03021240234375,
        335.478759765625
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 6 New evidence has prompted addition in this second edition of a chapter ( ) on TB",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        330.978759765625,
        504.840087890625,
        346.6487731933594
      ],
      "text": "management in HIV-positive children: children living with HIV infection are at increased risk of",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        342.978759765625,
        473.920166015625,
        358.6487731933594
      ],
      "text": "TB exposure, infection, progression to disease, and TB-related morbidity and mortality.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        363.8387756347656,
        480.610107421875,
        379.5087890625
      ],
      "text": "In the second edition, greater attention is given to the management of drug-resistant TB",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        375.32879638671875,
        486.3500671386719,
        392.3387756347656
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 7 in children ( ). WHO has published guidelines for the approach to diagnosis and",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        387.8387756347656,
        492.2601013183594,
        403.5087890625
      ],
      "text": "treatment of drug-resistant TB based on experience in adults; the most recent version was",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        399.8387756347656,
        478.0501403808594,
        415.5087890625
      ],
      "text": "updated in 2011. Chapter 7 outlines treatment of mono-resistant, poly-resistant TB and",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        411.8387756347656,
        238.50030517578125,
        427.5087890625
      ],
      "text": "multidrug-resistant TB (MDR-TB).",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        432.41876220703125,
        511.62017822265625,
        449.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 8  With respect to implementation and management by the NTP, provides more details",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        444.92877197265625,
        503.3802490234375,
        460.5987854003906
      ],
      "text": "on the steps to be taken at global and national level. It highlights the importance of recording",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        456.92877197265625,
        415.7601013183594,
        472.5987854003906
      ],
      "text": "and reporting, the need for training and the importance of integrated care.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        477.7887878417969,
        490.8000793457031,
        493.45880126953125
      ],
      "text": "During the process of updating the guidance, note was taken of areas in which insufficient",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        489.7887878417969,
        511.6201477050781,
        505.45880126953125
      ],
      "text": "evidence is currently available and further research is needed. A summary of research priorities",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        501.27880859375,
        197.3903045654297,
        518.288818359375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 9 is included in  .",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        522.3687744140625,
        502.85003662109375,
        539.3787841796875
      ],
      "text": "Annex 2  includes the recently revised TB case and treatment outcome definitions to be used",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        534.8787841796875,
        208.8603057861328,
        550.5487670898438
      ],
      "text": "for recording and reporting.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        555.4588012695312,
        481.6900939941406,
        572.4688110351562
      ],
      "text": "Annex 5  provides interim guidelines for treatment of TB in young children (weighing less",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        567.9688110351562,
        494.8600769042969,
        583.6387939453125
      ],
      "text": "than 25 kg) using currently available fixed-dose combinations (RHZ 60/30/150) and dosage",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.4302978515625,
        579.9688110351562,
        204.78030395507812,
        595.6387939453125
      ],
      "text": "achieved per weight band.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "10",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
